{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02774","headline":"赤谷安禅师塔 · 卢照邻","name":"赤谷安禅师塔","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"独坐岩之曲，悠然无俗纷。\n酌酒呈丹桂，思诗赠白云。\n烟霞朝晚聚，猿鸟岁时闻。\n水华竞秋色，山翠含夕曛。\n高谈十二部，细核五千文。\n如如数冥味，生生理氛氲。\n古人有糟粕，轮扁情未分。\n且当事芝术，从吾所好云。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢照邻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02774.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02774","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}